CHAPTER III

FORMS OF VIOLENCE

Article 4

Forms of violence include:
a. Physical violence;
b. Psychological violence;
c. Sexual violence;
d. Neglect;
e. Maltreatment;
f. Exploitation; and/or
g. Other violence.

