REGIONAL REGULATION OF POHUWATO REGENCY

NUMBER 6 OF 2018

CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

REGENT OF POHUWATO,

Considering:

a. that to restore the dignity and honor of women and children victims of violence and to restore their social function, it is necessary to undertake efforts for protection, empowerment of women, and rehabilitation of children victims of violence;
b. that based on Article 12 of Law 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government, empowerment of women and protection of children constitute mandatory governmental affairs for regional governments;
C. that based on the considerations as referred to in letters a and b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Protection of Women and Children Victims of Violence.

In view of:

1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 38 of 2000 concerning Establishment of Gorontalo Province (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2000 Number 258, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4060);
