REGIONAL REGULATION OF POHUWATO REGENCY

NUMBER 6 OF 2018

CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

REGENT OF POHUWATO,

Considering:

a. that to restore the dignity and honor of women and children victims of violence and to restore their social function, it is necessary to undertake efforts for protection, empowerment of women, and rehabilitation of children victims of violence;
b. that based on Article 12 of Law 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government, empowerment of women and protection of children constitute mandatory governmental affairs for regional governments;
C. that based on the considerations as referred to in letters a and b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Protection of Women and Children Victims of Violence.

In view of:

1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 38 of 2000 concerning Establishment of Gorontalo Province (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2000 Number 258, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4060);
3. Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2002 Number 109, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235) as amended by Law Number 35 of 2014 concerning Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 297, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number
5606. As amended by Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 17 of 2016 Stipulation of Government Regulation in Lieu of Law Number 1 of 2016 concerning Second Amendment to Law 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection into Law (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2016 Number 237, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5946);
4. Law Number 6 of 2003 concerning Establishment of Bone Bolango Regency and Pohuwato Regency in Gorontalo Province) State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2003 Number 26, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4269);
5. Law Number 23 of 2004 concerning Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);
6. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 11 of 2012 concerning Juvenile Criminal Justice System (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2012 Number 153, (Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5332);
7. Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587) as last amended by Law Number 9 of 2015 concerning Second Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2015 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5679);
8. Government Regulation Number 4 of 2006 concerning Implementation and Cooperation for Recovery of Victims of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2006 Number 15, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 64);

With mutual agreement,

REGIONAL HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES OF POHUWATO REGENCY

and

REGENT OF POHUWATO

DECIDES:

To establish:
REGIONAL REGULATION CONCERNING PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

